{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:629","content":{"id":629,"title":"有向图算法","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"473f16c9-23cc-4444-b8b5-2df40aa633c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际生活中的很多问题都可以建模为一个有向图的模型："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"31880932-28e0-475f-b265-0d4a07a25fc4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8049c50d-3002-4258-a3ce-8963eb792990","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fc98c26-338d-43a3-994c-de05cf738518","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"社交网络：图中的节点看做是一个个的人，如果一个节点指向一个节点，表示这个人关注了这个人，这种关注关系是有方向的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"65d06284-4504-4324-a0ea-9b83c86dbc47","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a714b731-04b3-44e8-a783-30720a60511d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学习课程：将图中的节点看做是一门门的课程，一门课程被其他课程所指向，表示学习这门课程之前需要学习其他的课程，这种学习顺序也是有指向关系的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"09270c46-a8a1-4741-8948-6ee123703b29","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be4ea1d1-15ba-47d1-8202-4970bbf1a082","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块引用：将图中的节点看做是一个个的程序模块，一个模块被其他模块指向，表示该模块依赖于其他模块，这种模块之间的依赖也是有方向的"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b234f40d-ffba-46c5-a119-a3dc2f2e8fa0.webp","uuid":"9998c729-6562-4320-ad81-75b3ea8bac29","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b234f40d-ffba-46c5-a119-a3dc2f2e8fa0.webp","width":418.74998336037066,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"bd2e4dde-0be6-4de8-ba5f-abdf8731ad1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"57b246dc-004e-4a7b-b595-86373cf15c25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有向图的表示"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4387e852-4bb3-486a-b5c6-494202d78d3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们之前介绍的无向图可以看做是一种特殊的有向图，所谓的特殊在于每个节点都互相指向。我们之前在 g.txt 值规定规定了节点之间的连接关系，所以我们当我们读取到下面的形式的时候"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"29d0a5a2-d97a-46cb-b2ca-4b0bf2b99336","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"699418c5-f8f4-4439-919c-56afca322555","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"0 1","collabId":"da7ee3d5-baf9-429c-b705-ab4172d37c92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31e8430d-2718-4d50-b7bb-ee5a1023de92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"表示的是节点 0 指向节点 1 以及节点 1 指向节点 0，所以我们在无向图中实现如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"f5fb1e7f-ccff-443a-b9fa-f6bda9f4f5ac","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5977885e-ae5a-45e2-97d0-f530f620d26e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"adj[0].add(1);\nadj[1].add(0);","collabId":"417f1d60-e496-4ac8-95da-68e775d46dba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b33eb08d-689b-4e1b-9c81-6aa1b12bb1d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们只是想表示节点 0 指向节点 1，我们就不需要添加下面那一行语句就好了。所以有向图对比于无向图的实现只需要更改这一个部分"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"0e405088-e4f7-46ab-b071-154d09057a87","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"25f01743-87cb-43c9-a480-2d39bd8b7f95","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.io.File;\nimport java.io.FileNotFoundException;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\nimport java.util.TreeSet;\n\npublic class DirectedGraph {\n    private int E;\n    private int V;\n    private TreeSet<Integer>[] adj;\n\n    public DirectedGraph(String filename) {\n        File file = new File(filename);\n        Scanner scanner = null;\n        try {\n            scanner = new Scanner(file);\n            this.V = scanner.nextInt();\n            if (this.V < 0) {\n                throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"V Must Be Positive\");\n            }\n\n            this.adj = new TreeSet[this.V];\n            for (int i = 0; i < this.V; i++) {\n                this.adj[i] = new TreeSet<>();\n            }\n\n            this.E = scanner.nextInt();\n            if (this.E < 0) {\n                throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"E Must Be Positive\");\n            }\n\n            this.inDegree = new int[V];\n            this.outDegree = new int[V];\n\n            for (int i = 0; i < this.E; i++) {\n                int a = scanner.nextInt();\n                validateVertex(a);\n                int b = scanner.nextInt();\n                validateVertex(b);\n\n                if (a == b) {\n                    throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Self loop exists\");\n                }\n                if (adj[a].contains(b)) {\n                    throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Parallel edge exists\");\n                }\n\n                // 只是删掉了 adj[b].add(a)\n                adj[a].add(b);\n            }\n        } catch (FileNotFoundException e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n        } finally {\n            assert scanner != null;\n            scanner.close();\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void validateVertex(int v) {\n        if (v < 0 || v >= this.V) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Vertex \" + v + \" is invalid\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    public int V() {\n        return this.V;\n    }\n\n    public int E() {\n        return this.E;\n    }\n\n    public Iterable<Integer> adj(int v) {\n        validateVertex(v);\n        return adj[v];\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public String toString() {\n        StringBuilder stringBuilder = new StringBuilder();\n        stringBuilder.append(String.format(\"V: %d, E: %d\\n\", this.V, this.E));\n        for (int v = 0; v < this.V; v++) {\n            stringBuilder.append(String.format(\"%d : \", v));\n            for (int w: adj(v)) {\n                stringBuilder.append(String.format(\"%d \", w));\n            }\n            stringBuilder.append(\"\\n\");\n        }\n        return stringBuilder.toString();\n    }\n}","collabId":"db8577cd-eb49-462a-937d-5789bb570ada","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_58753499-03c3-4415-86d4-95c5a3e9e5f2.webp","uuid":"ce3254fc-ee54-4819-ac73-e0229711d8a3","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_58753499-03c3-4415-86d4-95c5a3e9e5f2.webp","width":418.74998336037066,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0a4a6c59-51cb-4c61-b35f-e614c77ea148","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5acbb81f-2f4e-41b9-ad69-e39ab6de8f3c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以我们再次修改一下类 DirectedGraph 如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"43583ea5-b8bc-4db4-82cb-8b3ad854dbbd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c0db9e86-968e-4d69-ac13-0505c79d810a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.io.File;\nimport java.io.FileNotFoundException;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\nimport java.util.TreeSet;\n\npublic class DirectedGraph {\n    private int E;\n    private int V;\n    private TreeSet<Integer>[] adj;\n\n    // 增加入度和出度的成员变量\n    private int[] inDegree;\n    private int[] outDegree;\n\n    public DirectedGraph(String filename) {\n        File file = new File(filename);\n        Scanner scanner = null;\n        try {\n            // 其他代码相同\n\n            this.inDegree = new int[V];\n            this.outDegree = new int[V];\n\n            for (int i = 0; i < this.E; i++) {\n                // 其他代码相同\n\n                adj[a].add(b);\n                // 在这里初始化入度和出度，a → b，a的出度增加，b的入度增加\n                inDegree[b]++;\n                outDegree[a]++;\n            }\n        } catch (FileNotFoundException e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n        } finally {\n            assert scanner != null;\n            scanner.close();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public int inDegree(int v) {\n        validateVertex(v);\n        return inDegree[v];\n    }\n\n    public int outDegree(int v) {\n        validateVertex(v);\n        return outDegree[v];\n    }\n\n    // 其他方法\n}","collabId":"cd533e2a-2cac-45e0-9f1a-9e8ee812e6b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6bdf4b97-bb78-4470-a5da-7d62d38f92e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DFS"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eb5a8306-c834-459a-9881-2ed94660bbc6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于有向图来说，它的 DFS 代码和 BFS 代码同无向图的写法完全是一样的，因为在后文中需要用到 DFS 遍历，所以这里贴出有向图的 DFS 遍历代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"05e113e7-7904-4372-992d-12aab8a66c1a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"37754ad1-4977-420e-b16f-d87d7568637c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\n\npublic class DFSDirectedGraph {\n    private DirectedGraph graph;\n    // 深度优先前序遍历结果\n    private ArrayList<Integer> pre;\n    // 深度优先后序遍历结果\n    private ArrayList<Integer> post;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n\n    public DFSDirectedGraph(DirectedGraph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        this.pre = new ArrayList<>();\n        this.post = new ArrayList<>();\n        this.visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            if (!visited[v]) {\n                dfs(v);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void dfs(int v) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        pre.add(v);\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                dfs(w);\n            }\n        }\n        post.add(v);\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<Integer> pre() {\n        return pre;\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<Integer> post() {\n        return post;\n    }\n}","collabId":"4c6a0dc3-867c-47b3-99f4-0f64a56024d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e7d6231-5a64-461a-b190-ea91f3faeb14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可见上面的代码与无向图的 DFS 并无不同。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d97d653d-cb60-4496-ab7c-2614a1b7ca2d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有向图的环检测"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3c6f8c2-c6a3-4368-a898-8613ef640987","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"检测有向图中是否存在环是一件很有必要的事情"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1c0bd71c-5a84-4a7e-aa4a-1501d18425d7.webp","uuid":"d2508f9f-fcfe-4169-a972-dacf1aaae9a7","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1c0bd71c-5a84-4a7e-aa4a-1501d18425d7.webp","width":418.74998336037066,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"20c2cc67-1947-4070-ad5a-2bba8272fbee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"884f22fa-796b-47b4-a928-da5d0324d08c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果将上面的图看做是一个课程之间的依赖关系，如果图中存在环，说明课程之间相互依赖，学习课程 A 之前需要先学习课程 B，而学习课程 B 之前又需要先学习课程 A，这样的学习顺序肯定是有问题的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"313b1eec-3ff6-4a92-bf5c-9fff29ebea0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们想一想我们在无向图中是怎么做环检测的，我们使用 DFS 遍历，当遍历到一个节点时，如果某个邻接节点已经被访问了，并且不是它的父亲节点，我们就可以认为图中存在一个环。但是对于有向图就不一样了"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/106120074-e16af480-6190-11eb-8820-185600aa2852.gif","previewUrl":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/106120074-e16af480-6190-11eb-8820-185600aa2852.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"fc3736f9-14f5-439f-9c01-9954167d90cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d36b99af-afd5-40b1-8ece-8d6a766c4259","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的动图是优先遍历的顺序，最后我们来到了节点 3"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_13d1f009-15ae-4f8f-8ee5-a20b93d4a401.webp","uuid":"c33ca630-6761-4a7d-939d-c5ad097a12e0","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_13d1f009-15ae-4f8f-8ee5-a20b93d4a401.webp","width":460.41664837135284,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"35570cb2-1272-4382-b1d9-d4589bf643ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15a32182-289d-429a-8ea4-3f2da5ca1bf5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时我们发现节点 3 的相邻节点 2 已经被访问过了，并且节点 2 不是 3 的上一个节点，但是我们能说图中存在一个环吗? 不能，因为节点 2 无法到达节点 3，所以形成不了一个环。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"22858f62-0110-4f95-be23-66cd657cfb12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时我们需要另外一个变量来表示节点是否在路径上，如果一个节点访问邻接节点时发现该节点已经被访问过且在路径上，我们就可以说构成了一个环。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"8ea1f79e-0491-4b89-9378-093029f545aa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b6972df-d6aa-4664-b263-6b057af83189","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么叫在路径上，如果这个节点还没有回溯到上一个节点，我们就说这个节点在路径上。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf830cf4-a2e8-4ea0-8ef8-00d4f1baaeea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们在访问到节点 w 时，节点 v 还在路径上，说明节点 v 可以到达节点 w，如果此时节点 w 可以到达节点 v 不就说明存在一个环吗。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"54840ffc-3a46-477c-b696-fa185659044d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0a625df8-f9f5-443a-b5d7-75b719f93751","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public class DirectedCycleDetect {\n    private DirectedGraph graph;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    // onPath[w] 表示节点 w 是否在路径上\n    private boolean[] onPath;\n    private boolean hasCycle;\n\n    public DirectedCycleDetect(DirectedGraph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        this.visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n        this.onPath = new boolean[graph.V()];\n        this.hasCycle = false;\n\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            if (!visited[v]) {\n                if (dfs(v)) {\n                    hasCycle = true;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private boolean dfs(int v) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        onPath[v] = true;\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                if (dfs(w)) {\n                    return true;\n                }\n            // 通无向图不同，2 -> 1 -> 2 也是一个环\n            } else if (onPath[w]) {\n                return true;\n            }\n        }\n        // 回溯到上一个节点时就不在路径上了\n        onPath[v] = false;\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    public boolean isHasCycle() {\n        return hasCycle;\n    }\n}","collabId":"1b29a14f-a393-4082-9d72-866d6bcb0ccb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"fe7d2a14-01bb-495f-8424-88860f5410c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"拓扑排序"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9e2ccb3c-8c01-47e9-bdf6-1da5a9230221","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还是对于下面的这么一副图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_afb7077f-c5bb-41b7-a8b5-2e9d967da7ab.webp","uuid":"6685f0bc-3c53-49c8-8474-98ec26e2e99c","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_afb7077f-c5bb-41b7-a8b5-2e9d967da7ab.webp","width":418.74998336037066,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6e6958dc-a8dd-4cec-b744-509faa5e2a2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a7b28ba-e42d-40c0-9f88-bbb355ac83f8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设上面的节点代表一门课程的话，我们想知道应该以什么样的顺序学习所有的课程，这其实就是在寻找图的拓扑排序。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a2121ff-612c-47cc-9ae4-9beade29bbc0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么我们寻找图的拓扑排序呢? 还是以学习课程举例，要学习一门课，那么这门就不能依赖于任何一门其他的课，或者这门课已经被学过了，就比如上面我们应该先学习课程 0，因为没有任何课程指向它，它不依赖于任何课程，以图论的语言来说，因为节点 0 的入度为 0，所以先学习课程 0。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dbd929bc-57f2-4b9b-872f-276443c60242.webp","uuid":"d4fdf211-0a9b-45a2-9cdb-e069e3f49377","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dbd929bc-57f2-4b9b-872f-276443c60242.webp","width":596.2499763071546,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2523b689-5602-40ae-962a-03320e53a46d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f04db4e-fd6e-4e56-bbee-822d24f82a17","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学习完课程 0 之后，为了表示这门课程已经学过，我们将依赖于节点 0 的节点的入度减一"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/106124358-fac26f80-6195-11eb-91b2-38f37d808597.png","previewUrl":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/106124358-fac26f80-6195-11eb-91b2-38f37d808597.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5ba7548c-18fa-488b-9ec2-85ecb84904d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1fa14e87-2ebf-4be6-8a01-57d090be2eed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来我们应该学习哪门课呢? 当然是入度为 0 的课，表示不需要前置课程或者前置课程已经学过了，所以我们接下来学习课程 1，并且将依赖课程 1 的其他课程的入度减一"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1222dc8b-bf62-4631-a7cd-84613a391b18.webp","uuid":"ef6b5712-6b71-4f20-b0fe-fefc9de99f1f","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1222dc8b-bf62-4631-a7cd-84613a391b18.webp","width":597.0833096073743,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8658a115-afe0-4f19-bf40-be506ac70249","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b85a2ae-bc0f-4ba2-a26b-a0623dca2a16","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来还是学习入度为 0 的课程，即课程 3，并且更新依赖课程 3 的其他课程的入度"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_593cb92e-25ae-482c-81f8-678031e91662.webp","uuid":"3eac28ec-e1de-4c03-9549-bdaad4da0142","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_593cb92e-25ae-482c-81f8-678031e91662.webp","width":569.583310700126,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5f9b0b92-e397-40d1-a01e-22022c6b4dd9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19a1dd75-1365-4652-b3d0-cea4e0310d44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着学习课程 `2`，因为它的入度为 `0`，然后更新依赖课程 `2` 的其他课程的入度"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e9434e48-4ce6-4d9c-a165-a5fd6023d777.webp","uuid":"585b7c3b-e39f-4831-ae23-a0c07b3668a5","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e9434e48-4ce6-4d9c-a165-a5fd6023d777.webp","width":569.583310700126,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"ed7bb516-cf3d-4b2e-9dc1-4dbaaf2623a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b19674f1-a858-4fca-9e51-4f4554df2a79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后学习课程 4"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7f8985da-ddc6-4f74-8422-732e578092b7.webp","uuid":"0b385369-c5ec-41b1-a0a4-410d3a9506e8","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7f8985da-ddc6-4f74-8422-732e578092b7.webp","width":547.9166448944153,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"b5db3085-4656-4a4d-8c82-d6abca1249d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e82f4bcc-d08c-498a-9569-bf556e561297","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以最终课程的学习顺序为 0 → 1 → 3 → 2 → 4，也就是拓扑排序的结果。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af5bf7ce-5fa3-4416-92a9-1fb688b06cd5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以我们对图做拓扑排序，就重复做两步："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9d08fef0-be6d-43f1-8c58-cd5f3cd90ee7","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"375ed590-493b-4950-9d21-d2dfeb951846","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a95c19e-c457-4e7b-955b-93b8030b1652","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选择入度为 0 的节点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"72d9b863-5032-4ee7-9563-6559a3419b7d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ecaf2f2f-d1c8-4413-a125-cdfe83a13cdf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更新相邻节点的入度"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a096611-3914-48b5-87ef-ba57c11626a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外一个需要注意的问题就是，拓扑排序只对有向无环图(DAG) 有效，如果图中有环，二者相互依赖，就不知道先学习哪一门课程了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af011724-174e-4f08-9beb-7a5dfbc406f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在代码的实现方面，我们使用队列来存储入度为 0 的节点，在更新相邻节点入度的时候，如果入度为 0 则添加进队列中，每次从队列取出一个值时，我们添加到一个 List 中，表示拓扑排序的顺序。另外如果图中存在环的话，那么这个 List 中保存的节点数目肯定小于整个图的节点数目，此时可以使用拓扑排序来做环检测。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"266bdb19-755d-4198-8aa0-5dcbd71b6cd6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f49348b6-0b06-41e2-abc2-06101d2e0f30","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.LinkedList;\nimport java.util.Queue;\n\npublic class TopoSort {\n    private DirectedGraph graph;\n    private int[] inDegree;\n    private ArrayList<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();\n    private boolean hasCycle = false;\n\n    public TopoSort(DirectedGraph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        this.inDegree = new int[graph.V()];\n\n        Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            inDegree[v] = graph.inDegree(v);\n            if (inDegree[v] == 0) {\n                queue.add(v);\n            }\n        }\n\n        while (!queue.isEmpty()) {\n            int v = queue.remove();\n            result.add(v);\n            for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                inDegree[w]--;\n                if (inDegree[w] == 0) {\n                    queue.add(w);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (result.size() != graph.V()) {\n            hasCycle = true;\n            result.clear();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public boolean isHasCycle() {\n        return hasCycle;\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<Integer> result() {\n        return result;\n    }\n}","collabId":"fa12fdca-8b24-4c8e-813b-fa4ef98af929","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9cec42e1-952a-40a3-ba2a-258460523333","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时我们在介绍一种拓扑排序的算法，它需要借助于深度优先后序遍历。回顾一个后序遍历的概念，后序遍历指的是先访问完相邻节点，然后访问自己。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"675b662c-b4b7-4086-8c20-168ce3f24b87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于有向图意味着什么，意味着先访问依赖自己的节点，然后访问自己，说明自己是在依赖于自己的节点之后访问的，如果我们对深度优先后序遍历做一个逆序，这个顺序就表示自己在依赖于自己的节点之前被访问的，这不就是拓扑排序的结果吗。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"967c45d3-aeab-46ed-924e-ea2ab2567d76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用深度优先后序遍历有一个缺点就是它不能做环检测，虽然图中有环，但是还是能够深度优先后序遍历，只不过此时结果便没有意义了。所以在使用这个方法做拓扑排序之前，我们需要使用我们之前讲解的有向图的环检测算法进行环检测"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"30f114e3-bb6f-4115-886b-5980bf8634a7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1e1a24d4-206e-4959-b1e5-489177efc0fb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Collections;\n\npublic class TopoSort2 {\n    private DirectedGraph graph;\n    private boolean hasCycle;\n    private ArrayList<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();\n\n    public TopoSort2(DirectedGraph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        // 使用之前的讲解的环检测类进行环检测\n        DirectedCycleDetect directedCycleDetect = new DirectedCycleDetect(graph);\n        this.hasCycle = directedCycleDetect.isHasCycle();\n\n        if (hasCycle) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // 对图做深度优先后序遍历\n        DFSDirectedGraph dfsDirectedGraph = new DFSDirectedGraph(graph);\n        for (int v: dfsDirectedGraph.post()) {\n            result.add(v);\n        }\n        // 对后序遍历取逆序\n        Collections.reverse(result);\n    }\n\n    public boolean isHasCycle() {\n        return hasCycle;\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<Integer> result() {\n        return result;\n    }\n}","collabId":"65ba90fd-ba3a-4761-8f21-a7eb0e985444","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"afe6ce41-858f-496c-8c81-9da0b1289b27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"强连通分量"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"44281032-efd0-44a7-8a08-c3960dab8416","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在还有一个问题就是我们怎么检测图中有多少个强联通分量，以及每一个强联通分量中包含哪些节点。所谓的强联通分量指如果某些节点互相可达，那么这些节点就组成了一个强联通分量。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_da4fbc2b-3378-4d4f-b778-af8ee617b80b.webp","uuid":"32220dc7-4805-4074-98ac-99a25a5f28f5","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_da4fbc2b-3378-4d4f-b778-af8ee617b80b.webp","width":595.416643006935,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"07a2abfc-9bb4-4310-a08c-6ff53fea23b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be61b312-99ac-42b0-961d-46d65045917b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如上图就三个强联通分量，每个联通分量内部的节点都是互相可达的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ee1a7f75-a55b-4f11-b54b-c10a1bbfa95c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在求解有向图的联通分量之前，我们回顾一下无向图的联通分量是如何求解的，我们从任意一个节点开始做 DFS，每次做一次 DFS 就表示有一个联通分量"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"d1b9dc5f-69f4-4615-8370-04831e79969a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f9c95637-376c-48a1-9448-830352ed8080","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"for (int i = 0; i < visited.length; i++) {\n    if (!visited[i]) {\n        cccount++; // 联通分量个数增加\n        dfs(i);\n    }\n}","collabId":"2aec3a4e-6a2d-4b95-a2d4-dc89af5be1cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91573873-305c-470c-b99e-f11872117ee3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是对于有向图我们能从任意一个节点开始吗? 答案是不行，而是要以特定的顺序遍历。如果我们将一个个的联通分量看做是一个图中的节点"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f990cc61-a021-423a-9c6b-c6fe063090f2.webp","uuid":"ac6e0de3-2eea-45be-8f15-4ca5cf29b546","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f990cc61-a021-423a-9c6b-c6fe063090f2.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"9b538eb2-eb9c-41df-bf37-97ea096e49f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"202e77ee-97af-41d8-b48f-7d46f2b4a270","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们分别遍历联通分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow B","collabId":"41263dd3-7b6e-4dd3-997c-a626824c3abc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow B"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点，那么每做一次 DFS 就就可以统计联通分量数目，那么为什么会是上面的顺序呢?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3c58a2ab-62c2-492c-b743-3c959529e28f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么从 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"c09262d5-1987-47eb-a3c0-989a739061ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始遍历，因为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"a2991521-b37f-4484-b502-f53c50120072","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只依赖其他联通分量的节点，没有其他联通分量依赖于它，所以从 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"33c00a14-3247-4cdf-8274-b49b58365ee6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的某个节点做 DFS，只能遍历到联通分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"0eb039ad-8d39-4e23-8a5e-214296d35f53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点。同理遍历完了 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"4080d877-c002-4117-a68a-ff0403406ebd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，此时 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"f9f558ff-c0c4-4ff7-a2ad-3575f673072f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也只依赖于其他联通分量，虽然 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"c9b70396-89fb-45c0-95d7-2f60ba73a819","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 依赖于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"af3a168f-c8c7-4605-9089-18288233264b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"95569407-2f59-4a0b-8b9d-90f12887ce7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 已经遍历完毕了，所以此时从 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"3e1bb2e0-9746-420e-b93a-bfe44d953090","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点开始做 DFS 只能遍历到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"1bdcb0f6-28dc-4ffe-9a67-fe05b93fc876","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中所有的节点，剩余的也是同理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"964270df-cef7-4b86-93ca-a4f458f90ede","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也就是说依赖于自己的联通分量要被先遍历到，也就是相邻节点要在自己之前被访问到，其实就是深度优先后序遍历的顺序，所以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow B","collabId":"1630b78a-32a8-4438-8d22-b10e55f6b9cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow B"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个顺序其实是深度优先后序遍历的顺序。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dc6295fd-fb50-4660-9aea-65a08547ca21","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是这个深度优先后序遍历指的是以联通分量作为节点进行的遍历，如果我们从任意一个节点做深度优先后序遍历是得不到这个顺序的。例如我们从联通分量中的节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"D","collabId":"58d036b4-f74c-4c62-95fd-cd7acf6ff9a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"D"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始遍历，接着来到了联通分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"de87aeed-f398-4eb1-986f-3b81861554ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，虽然遍历完联通分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"6508f00c-37d3-48d8-91f2-3f939dcf7cb0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中所有节点之前肯定需要遍历完联通分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"94150bd5-34a7-424c-ae52-0691d24baca0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是不能保证所有 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"7981318f-bb41-4a06-a983-81530dd7e313","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点都在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"98312e77-6c16-4bf7-ab99-da2f6118293f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历，即可能有这样的顺序 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C_1 \\rightarrow E \\rightarrow C_2 \\rightarrow \\cdots","collabId":"6cb80ec5-b1eb-4679-ab6f-bab64a423ca7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C_1 \\rightarrow E \\rightarrow C_2 \\rightarrow \\cdots"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这样的顺序是我们不想要的，因为我们必须从联通分量 $E$ 中的节点开始遍历。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79b27830-043c-4567-95f1-85ec00b0d6f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然上面的深度优先遍历不能严格按照 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow B","collabId":"b88b8fc4-71cf-4466-8f72-0111105e266d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow B"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的顺序遍历，但是我们发现一定有分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"cddf42ad-053c-421d-ab0d-efc02c1ea1a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点在分量 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"f03b6af7-f176-4e6f-9f1c-ff2fe161062e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 遍历完之后遍历的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C_1 \\rightarrow E \\rightarrow C_2 \\rightarrow \\cdots","collabId":"0298b39a-f708-414b-a6ce-b6788cffe82a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C_1 \\rightarrow E \\rightarrow C_2 \\rightarrow \\cdots"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，例如 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C_2","collabId":"0ed0eb90-64d9-4475-a027-7b60320496f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C_2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在遍历完 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"9a739f0a-8df4-465a-bbb6-01efa8f59454","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之后被遍历了，这给了我们灵感，如果我们取个逆，就可以得到一定有 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"f6e14c5c-0fa9-437e-b4f1-6348d60e7677","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"e36cb02a-8984-490d-bc37-b318bbf0ffb9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分量节点被遍历之前遍历。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31a4fe0f-6e69-4a2a-a270-5b5c5519f02e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而我们想要的是一定要 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"0caa6edd-9d7d-4874-8b78-9f430494e908","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"fd9f99e4-4300-417f-8485-5dace4526425","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点被遍历之前遍历，怎么办，我们将整个图的方向改变一下，原来是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"a \\rightarrow b","collabId":"53a66f8a-5562-4f1b-98ae-7a75f15d74f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a \\rightarrow b"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，现在变为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"b \\rightarrow a","collabId":"a1784c87-8277-41f0-8f77-3c2ac16981d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"b \\rightarrow a"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7a2f161b-bcfd-4fe8-b4ba-10039d792b77.webp","uuid":"27d6553d-822b-4929-88b5-9b7461fa599b","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7a2f161b-bcfd-4fe8-b4ba-10039d792b77.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"76e7ec91-8d90-4c77-baa2-9901be370261","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8109a3f0-3f6a-4224-866f-26314e417732","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后进行深度优先后序遍历，然后取个逆就可以保证一定有在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"E","collabId":"584529f1-1c0a-4577-92fc-c2d5d353e09b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"E"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"b29ea45e-141c-4ac5-bbe0-8a952c3bd405","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点遍历之前被遍历到，同理可以得到一定有 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"C","collabId":"e24fdbdf-cf57-4920-b8e7-28d717fd76af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"D","collabId":"ece7d185-a8a9-4746-a075-692a0a727902","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"D"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的节点被遍历之前被遍历到，这就达到我们的目的，我们再根据这个顺序做 DFS 就可以统计出联通分量的个数了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e01f39e-995d-4daa-814d-1a955749bce9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面这个算法就是 Kosaraju 算法，总结上面的步骤如下："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"968903e3-80c8-4841-bb5a-8e480fab139b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"48a6cbce-b3e8-4071-95f1-f1e829af19da","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d898ce4e-b043-4dfd-b8c3-fc47c24c3bb4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图翻转得到反图"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1b778595-04d8-4bc2-a8d0-ad23c6c98bef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5288210f-f5c6-4b97-b76d-12163aaf2c5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对反图做深度优先后序遍历，然后对遍历结果取逆"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4a30ea05-5fc8-4da2-8df0-509e3179e966","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4112a1d8-fbbd-4870-96c4-29f773b8b39b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据取逆后的结果依次做 DFS，统计联通分量个数"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"9a9abf75-4839-4456-ba4d-4c198a3c29cc","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1644993f-027f-4ac8-acfc-ba008a30f470","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Collections;\nimport java.util.TreeSet;\n\npublic class StrongCC {\n    private DirectedGraph graph;\n    private int[] visited;\n    private int scccount;\n\n    public StrongCC(DirectedGraph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        this.visited = new int[graph.V()];\n        Arrays.fill(visited, -1);\n        this.scccount = 0;\n\n        // 翻转图\n        TreeSet<Integer>[] reverse = new TreeSet[graph.V()];\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            reverse[i] = new TreeSet<>();\n        }\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                reverse[w].add(v);\n            }\n        }\n        // 对翻转图做 DFS\n        DFSDirectedGraph dfsDirectedGraph = new DFSDirectedGraph(new DirectedGraph(reverse));\n\n        // 对深度优先后序遍历取逆\n        ArrayList<Integer> res = dfsDirectedGraph.post();\n        Collections.reverse(res);\n\n        // 依次做 DFS，每做一次 DFS，联通分量个数增加\n        for(int v: res) {\n            if (visited[v] == -1) {\n                dfs(v, scccount);\n                scccount++;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void dfs(int v, int id) {\n        visited[v] = id;\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            if (visited[w] == -1) {\n                dfs(w, id);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<Integer>[] components() {\n        ArrayList<Integer>[] results = new ArrayList[scccount];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i< scccount; i++) {\n            results[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n        }\n\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            results[visited[v]].add(v);\n        }\n        return results;\n    }\n}","collabId":"82239d37-5485-47ac-ae9e-e0a4d1f91ba3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"10bfafc1-28db-40f3-a062-9a59e150c92a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"有向图算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:629","type":"doc","id":629}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Floyed 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:628","type":"doc","id":628}},"nextPage":{"title":"网络流与最大流","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:631","type":"doc","id":631}},"createTime":1702090428157,"updateTime":1775929421699,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929421699}}